            <h1>JolaxPay Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>This policy explains what information we collect, why we use it, who we may share it with, and the choices and rights available to you when you use JolaxPay.</p>
            <span class="updated">Effective date: 25 September 2026</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="wrap layout">
        <aside class="toc" aria-label="Privacy policy contents">
            <strong>On this page</strong>
            <nav>
                <a href="#scope">1. Scope</a><a href="#information">2. Information we collect</a>
                <a href="#use">3. How we use information</a><a href="#basis">4. Lawful bases</a>
                <a href="#sharing">5. Sharing and processors</a><a href="#transfers">6. International transfers</a>
                <a href="#retention">7. Retention</a><a href="#security">8. Security</a>
                <a href="#rights">9. Your rights</a><a href="#children">10. Children</a>
